1
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:06,400
Four notes. That is the whole idea.

2
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:13,200
Say it again, then turn it upside down.

3
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:21,000
Now stretch it: same shape, more time.

4
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:26,200
Let the page open into a landscape.

5
00:00:28,400 --> 00:00:34,200
Layer them, and mirror one voice against another.

6
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:40,000
Build it louder, then bring it home.

7
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:49,200
Four notes were enough.
